; A pushmeta takes one metadata value, and its line ends after it. Anything
; more is a syntax error that drops the pushmeta, so the popmeta that would
; close it pops an absent key. A date after the value starts a directive of
; its own, which is kept: the second open of Assets:A is a duplicate.
pushmeta one: "a" ^link
popmeta one:

pushmeta two: 1 USD 2
popmeta two:

pushmeta three: "a"2020-01-02 open Assets:A
2020-01-03 open Assets:A

pushmeta sum: 2 + 3
popmeta sum:
